WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
S0 ordinary-service baseline: AI is off; paper, staffed, and accessible routes run first.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
S1 isolated proofing: public or synthetic questions only; no output reaches the public.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
S2 shadow parallel service: AI suggestions reach human review while the ordinary desk stays primary.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000
S3 Six-Gate public proof: all gates pass and the user receives an eight-field Civic Proof Receipt.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.000
Human handoff and appeal: 120 seconds is an unmeasured concept target; a miss returns the case for retranslation.

00:15.000 --> 00:18.000
S4 adopt, retranslate, or retire: only limited adoption, retranslation, or removal of the AI layer is allowed.
